    },
    {
      "id": "inWhDNNjg9ubReovQiO5q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1972.3567833353668,
      "y": -2114.5410130847863,
      "width": 345.93572998046875,
      "height": 30,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#846358",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "K_ICY4i5er36Lg2ZSibNq"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aX",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1424124724,
      "version": 520,
      "versionNonce": 737330956,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766606075789,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "工作站服务：\n让 Windows 客户端可以通过 SMB 协议 访问网络上的共享资源（比如共享文件夹、打印机）。\n举例：你在 Windows 上用 \\\\192.168.1.100\\share 访问另一台电脑的共享目录，就是它在工作。",
      "fontSize": 8,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "工作站服务：\n让 Windows 客户端可以通过 SMB 协议 访问网络上的共享资源（比如共享文件夹、打印机）。\n举例：你在 Windows 上用 \\\\192.168.1.100\\share 访问另一台电脑的共享目录，就是它在工作。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KTGq2h57uGigmM1kMbDjo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1971.7620189301256,
      "y": -2066.4874315107213,
      "width": 284.15997314453125,
      "height": 30,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#846358",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "K_ICY4i5er36Lg2ZSibNq"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 961995956,
      "version": 645,
      "versionNonce": 1456078772,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766606075789,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "服务器服务：\n负责在本机上提供共享资源，比如共享文件夹、打印机，供别人通过网络访问。\n和上面的“工作站服务”互补：一个是“访问别人”，一个是“把自己资源分享出去”。",
      "fontSize": 8,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "服务器服务：\n负责在本机上提供共享资源，比如共享文件夹、打印机，供别人通过网络访问。\n和上面的“工作站服务”互补：一个是“访问别人”，一个是“把自己资源分享出去”。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
